      "content": "it's not about a treatment plan or anything. i don't think it's something that can be fixed with a doctor. it just feels like the world is too loud and too heavy to ever be at peace. i'm just so tired of fighting it. i keep thinking about what real peace would actually feel like... that total, perfect silence where nothing can reach me anymore. is that even possible?",
